00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.958
It has been half a century since the four
great revolutions in medical treatment--

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:22.750
Genetic manipulation, regeneration,
nanomachines, and panaceas--

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:30.083
Made the first society in the world
with no need for doctors into a reality.

00:01:30.292 --> 00:01:34.250
It is finally time to celebrate
the first generation of people

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:37.542
who have lived past the average
natural life span of 120 years

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.375
in the "Qualification Ceremony”
on September 15

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:45.083
at the Yo yogi Olympic Gymnasium in Tokyo.

00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:48.000
This first generation consists
of those great pioneers

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:54.000
who shouldered the burden of reconstruction
and development after World War Il.

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:57.000
Their health in their old age is something

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:57.500
that also gives those of us in
the younger generations hope.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.917
"Health and life bring happiness" that also gives
those of us in the younger generations hope.

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:00.125
