00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.333
Yes. He's losing connection with
S.H.E.L.L.'s H.U.M.A.N. Network.

00:03:20.542 --> 00:03:22.208
| can't stop it.

00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:55.833
Anti-GRMP drugs again?

00:03:56.042 --> 00:03:58.833
If Masao Horiki has developed a new drug,

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:01.750
