the recent rash of Lost phenomena.

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:03.083
There's a sudden change in the target!

00:04:03.292 --> 00:04:04.958
The GRMPs inside his body are going crazy!

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:06.292
It's me.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.833
| want us to be prepared to deal with Horiki.

00:04:09.042 --> 00:04:11.208
Secure his person on sight.

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:15.042
But he is outside of the network.
It will be difficult to find him.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.250
Seal off the whole area.

00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:18.292
We're in the middle of the 4 a.m.
rush hour to get home.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.458
