to all the citizens of this country.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:24.167
The Civilization Bringing Curve
is showing change.

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:26.625
It's unclear whether Horiki is the cause or not,

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:31.417
