whole country might be turned into Lost.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.958
The man has become Lost!

00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:08.875
Squad 1, begin descent!

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:19.667
Everyone, activate your stealth suits
and device swords immediately!

00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:23.917
