00:06:13.083 --> 00:06:13.708
Fall back!

00:06:13.917 --> 00:06:16.583
Roger! Falling back!

00:06:29.417 --> 00:06:30.833
Injecting!

00:06:43.625 --> 00:06:46.292
Zero, this is Bravo. The Lost is silent.

00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:51.333
All right, begin the collection process.

