00:08:18.375 --> 00:08:21.833
It's not easy to live the good life, buddy.

00:08:22.042 --> 00:08:23.625
Oh, Takeichi!

00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:27.667
S.H.E.L.L. won't let you die
