I'm getting a number of requests for GRMP
activation in the Yokohama District.

00:19:31.125 --> 00:19:32.333
We're on it.

00:19:32.542 --> 00:19:36.333
A gang of Route 16 workers
are heading north in a rampage.

00:19:36.542 --> 00:19:40.708
It appears that they are acting extremely
recklessly since they know they won't die.

00:19:40.917 --> 00:19:45.375
Feeling pleasure from injuring
one's own body and the like

00:19:45.583 --> 00:19:50.458
is a sickness brought about by S.H.E.L.L.
in its quest to bring sound health to all.

00:19:50.667 --> 00:19:54.458
Like apotemnophilia?

00:19:54.667 --> 00:19:57.875
That's something I'd like the Qualified to hear.

00:19:58.083 --> 00:20:01.542
Opinions from people like us won't reach them.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:04.750
More importantly,
have anti-GRMP drugs been detected?

00:20:04.958 --> 00:20:08.167
Yes, we're getting a number
of responses from that same group.

00:20:08.375 --> 00:20:11.000
It's still unclear whether
they will become Lost or not.

00:20:21.542 --> 00:20:22.792
Don't let the dogs get close!

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.833
What're you gonna do if this explodes here?!

00:20:26.875 --> 00:20:29.500
Are we really going to use bombs?

00:20:29.708 --> 00:20:31.042
Huh?!

00:20:32.083 --> 00:20:34.958
What's with those eyes...?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.458
| wonder if it's because of Mr. Masao's drug...

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.125
| feel great for some reason!

00:20:54.917 --> 00:21:00.167
I'm starting to feel like we can
really end this all today!

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.333
As I thought...

00:21:05.542 --> 00:21:07.958
The Civilization Bringing Curve
is being affected!

00:21:07.958 --> 00:21:08.375
"Sound Health" The Civilization
Bringing Curve is being affected!

00:21:08.375 --> 00:21:09.917
"Sound Health"

00:21:09.917 --> 00:21:11.125
"Sound Health"
This is...?!

00:21:11.125 --> 00:21:11.333
This is...?!

00:21:29.542 --> 00:21:30.917
It's unmanned...?

00:21:33.208 --> 00:21:34.625
H.I.L.A.M., huh?

00:21:34.833 --> 00:21:36.042
An unmanned car?

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.250
If that's not the case, then it's someone
who's been Lost from the Net...

00:21:39.458 --> 00:21:42.792
In other words, it's another Applicant,
like me, driving the car.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.958
Masao Horiki...

00:21:45.167 --> 00:21:46.250
Where is it?!

00:21:46.458 --> 00:21:47.500
At the rear of the group.

00:21:47.708 --> 00:21:48.875
A gray sedan.

00:21:49.083 --> 00:21:50.125
Bastard...

00:21:50.333 --> 00:21:51.958
I've finally found you.

00:21:52.167 --> 00:21:54.542
Wait. Are you sure it's Horiki?

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.375
Why is he with a gang?

00:21:57.583 --> 00:22:00.792
Could he be inducing a large
number of Lost phenomena

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.875
to bring forth the Third Applicant?

00:22:05.083 --> 00:22:08.000
The Third Applicant...?

00:22:08.208 --> 00:22:10.542
In order for mankind to overcome
the Lost phenomena,

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:13.875
we need a human who is completely
compatible with S.H.E.L.L.

00:22:14.083 --> 00:22:18.667
| believe the Third Applicant
will be born for that purpose.

00:22:18.875 --> 00:22:20.583
Don't be so hasty.

00:22:20.792 --> 00:22:25.042
With the current state of things, the only
way to protect S.H.E.L.L. and mankind

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:29.042
is by preserving the Civilization
Bringing Curve with the Qualified.

00:22:30.667 --> 00:22:36.125
If someone to lead the world does not
appear while this vision still exists...

00:22:36.333 --> 00:22:39.125
...we'll lose the future of restoration.

00:22:40.167 --> 00:22:45.833
Even if that's the case, what will we do
if the Third Applicant helps Horiki?

00:22:46.042 --> 00:22:48.208
Change from the fourth dispatch
to the third dispatch.

00:22:48.417 --> 00:22:50.125
Prioritize the elimination of the Lost.

00:22:50.333 --> 00:22:51.875
Even though he might be an Applicant?!

00:22:52.083 --> 00:22:55.750
Chief Shibuta! If you do that,
then Horiki will escape!

00:22:55.958 --> 00:22:57.625
Focus on avoiding risk.

00:22:57.833 --> 00:23:01.125
We must protect the current civilization...

00:23:01.333 --> 00:23:04.792
...not a future we don't know will ever appear.

00:23:06.042 --> 00:23:09.292
Yessir. Switch to the third dispatch!

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.833
Go around to the tunnel exit!

00:23:32.167 --> 00:23:34.083
You little...!

00:23:50.083 --> 00:23:52.583
Are you okay, Takeichi?!

00:23:52.792 --> 00:23:55.292
We're gonna keep going... to the Inside!

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.958
We're the ones who're gonna win!

00:24:15.833 --> 00:24:19.500
| can't catch up to him... Takeichi...

00:24:19.708 --> 00:24:21.625
Takeichi!

00:24:24.583 --> 00:24:29.375
Yozo... smile...

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:33.958
Lock down Rainbow Bridge!

00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:42.417
| can't believe they made it this far...
Jeez, it's a new record.

00:24:42.625 --> 00:24:43.750
Go!

00:24:45.333 --> 00:24:47.042
Don't screw this up!

00:25:28.292 --> 00:25:30.375
Takeichi...

00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:37.708
Forty-three seconds flat!

00:25:47.708 --> 00:25:49.500
He's gotten past the east gate!

00:25:49.708 --> 00:25:52.583
Lower the west gate! Hurry!

00:26:02.500 --> 00:26:03.917
Fire!

00:26:07.708 --> 00:26:11.208
Yee-haw!

00:26:27.958 --> 00:26:29.292
Takeichi!

00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:40.750
How's that?

00:26:47.875 --> 00:26:52.333
I... win...

00:27:02.750 --> 00:27:10.250
The Inside air... really is great.

00:27:27.333 --> 00:27:30.500
The police... Wait, it's not...?

00:27:32.917 --> 00:27:34.208
He's about to become Lost!

00:27:37.333 --> 00:27:39.458
Takeichi!

00:27:59.833 --> 00:28:01.375
Look out!

00:28:11.208 --> 00:28:12.458
Fire!

00:28:18.958 --> 00:28:20.583
There's one more person
showing signs of becoming Lost!

00:28:20.792 --> 00:28:21.750
A second one?!

00:28:21.958 --> 00:28:23.583
Be careful of the drag-in...

00:28:30.833 --> 00:28:31.875
Alpha's gotten caught up in it!

00:28:32.083 --> 00:28:33.750
We need to help right away--!

00:28:43.458 --> 00:28:45.375
A second Lost has appeared!

00:28:45.583 --> 00:28:47.250
Squad 1 has been completely defeated!

00:28:47.458 --> 00:28:49.458
Squad 2, go out with me!

00:28:49.667 --> 00:28:51.500
Force landing on Rainbow Bridge!

00:28:51.708 --> 00:28:53.833
Bring out all the drones, too!

00:29:09.375 --> 00:29:11.333
The rate of occurrence has improved,

00:29:11.542 --> 00:29:15.917
but he is not Orpheus. Another failure?

00:29:16.125 --> 00:29:17.792
Completely eliminate the Lost!

00:29:18.000 --> 00:29:20.750
Completely eliminating the Lost
is our first priority!

00:29:20.958 --> 00:29:22.375
Yoshiko, that's dangerous!

00:29:22.583 --> 00:29:26.583
| could feel a GRMP reaction
in the second Lost!

00:29:26.792 --> 00:29:28.125
What did you say?

00:29:38.125 --> 00:29:39.083
What's the matter?

00:29:39.292 --> 00:29:41.083
| can sense his consciousness...

00:29:41.292 --> 00:29:44.458
Consciousness? The Lost's?

00:29:45.250 --> 00:29:46.542
Wait!

00:30:27.833 --> 00:30:30.000
What is that...?

00:31:34.792 --> 00:31:35.458
No!

00:31:35.667 --> 00:31:37.250
Yoshiko!

00:32:04.250 --> 00:32:07.917
He went back... to human form...

00:32:14.875 --> 00:32:18.875
His life force and personality still remain.

00:32:19.083 --> 00:32:20.625
No way...

00:32:20.833 --> 00:32:24.167
He triggered the Human Lost
phenomenon, you know.

00:32:25.458 --> 00:32:29.625
This man is the one we have been waiting for.

00:32:31.792 --> 00:32:34.000
The Third Applicant!

00:32:45.042 --> 00:32:48.542
A new Civilization Bringing Curve?

00:32:48.750 --> 00:32:54.458
What is there besides the destruction
or restoration of civilization?

00:33:04.750 --> 00:33:07.958
The one who returned from
the underworld, Orpheus...

00:33:08.167 --> 00:33:12.083
It is time for humans to take back
what it means to be human.

00:33:20.750 --> 00:33:23.708
"The Second Notebook"

00:33:25.625 --> 00:33:29.875
"Inside the Route 7 Loop (Inside)
Marunouchi Area, Chiyoda Ward"

00:33:30.083 --> 00:33:31.750
"97 days until the Qualification Ceremony"

00:33:33.958 --> 00:33:38.417
"S.H.E.L.L."

00:33:42.708 --> 00:33:47.083
"H.I.L.A.M."

00:33:47.083 --> 00:33:47.458
"H.lLL.A.M."
Prioritizing life support.

00:33:47.458 --> 00:33:48.333
Prioritizing life support.

00:33:48.542 --> 00:33:50.667
Please tell me the person's name
or citizen registration number.

00:33:57.042 --> 00:33:59.375
I am Shibuta.

00:33:59.583 --> 00:34:02.917
Sorry for making you come all the way here.

00:34:03.125 --> 00:34:04.875
Think nothing of it.

00:34:05.083 --> 00:34:07.792
After all, the honorable Qualified
have become health indexes

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:11.542
and promised the citizens long life.

00:34:11.750 --> 00:34:14.250
Being of use to you all at any time

00:34:14.458 --> 00:34:19.417
is the job of S.H.E.L.L. agents as we
protect the health of everyday citizens.

00:34:19.625 --> 00:34:22.917
The predicted Third Applicant.

00:34:23.125 --> 00:34:25.792
Can you believe it?

00:34:26.000 --> 00:34:31.833
He was created from Masao Horiki's
anti-GRMP drug.

00:34:32.042 --> 00:34:34.167
| have lived for a long time,

00:34:34.375 --> 00:34:38.917
but this is the first time I've seen the
Civilization Bringing Curve so unstable.

00:34:39.125 --> 00:34:42.458
Shibuta, please state your opinion.

00:34:42.667 --> 00:34:43.667
Yes, sir.

00:34:43.875 --> 00:34:50.417
First, it is clear that Yozo Oba had
an effect on the Civilization Bringing Curve.

00:34:50.625 --> 00:34:54.208
Currently, we are investigating
whether the third curve

00:34:54.417 --> 00:34:59.458
will join with the restoration
or destruction of civilization.

00:34:59.667 --> 00:35:03.708
However, another Applicant, Yoshiko Hiiragi,

00:35:03.917 --> 00:35:07.458
has said that he is the key to
the restoration of civilization.

00:35:07.667 --> 00:35:08.917
Oh?

00:35:09.125 --> 00:35:13.458
Yozo Oba is different from the
Necromancer-type Masao Horiki

00:35:13.667 --> 00:35:16.750
and the Defense-type Yoshiko Hiiragi.

00:35:16.958 --> 00:35:21.083
He possesses the ability
to destroy Lost forms.

00:35:21.292 --> 00:35:26.208
| believe we can expect him to be
a trump card to use against Horiki.

00:35:26.417 --> 00:35:32.708
Are you saying that he was able to return
to human form even though he had been Lost?

00:35:32.917 --> 00:35:38.083
Yes. This is a phenomenon
we did not see in the other two.

00:35:38.292 --> 00:35:46.458
In other words, if we make Yozo Oba
one of the standards for health like us,

00:35:46.667 --> 00:35:52.708
then we should also be able to control
the Human Lost phenomenon?

00:35:52.917 --> 00:36:01.042
Yes. No matter what it takes, |, Shibuta,
stake my life on making this possible.

00:36:01.250 --> 00:36:03.375
That's the spirit.

00:36:03.583 --> 00:36:11.542
Let us make the dream of breaking through
a 180-year life span come true.

00:36:11.750 --> 00:36:12.833
Yes, ma'am.

00:36:13.042 --> 00:36:17.500
Let us appoint Yozo Oba
Qualified in the future.

00:36:17.708 --> 00:36:21.625
But only after we are able to control him fully.

00:36:21.833 --> 00:36:26.667
We must be careful when
determining the health standard.

00:36:26.875 --> 00:36:30.417
For the sake of the citizens, of course.

00:36:30.625 --> 00:36:33.500
| understand, sir.

00:36:59.042 --> 00:37:00.208
Yozo.

00:37:01.250 --> 00:37:03.958
You're really good, you know!

00:37:09.875 --> 00:37:11.875
Are you awake?

00:37:17.375 --> 00:37:20.333
What is this...?

00:37:20.542 --> 00:37:22.333
If I don't find anything unusual
after speaking with you,

00:37:22.542 --> 00:37:24.083
you'll be released right away.

00:37:25.333 --> 00:37:28.167
My name is Yoshiko Hiiragi.

00:37:29.125 --> 00:37:31.292
Yozo Oba.

00:37:32.250 --> 00:37:33.833
This is the Shibuta Agency.

00:37:34.042 --> 00:37:39.000
Our organization works on research and
development with S.H.E.L.L. to guarantee health.

00:37:39.208 --> 00:37:42.042
What is that monster?

00:37:42.250 --> 00:37:42.958
I---

00:37:43.167 --> 00:37:46.583
You died and were brought back to life.

00:37:46.792 --> 00:37:48.083
Huh...?

00:37:48.292 --> 00:37:50.792
The GRMPs in your body that
went wild are under control again,

00:37:51.000 --> 00:37:52.583
and you are back to normal.

00:37:52.792 --> 00:37:54.500
It's amazing.

00:37:54.708 --> 00:37:59.583
There is no doubt that you are
the Applicant who will save the world.

00:37:59.792 --> 00:38:02.917
What... are you saying...?

00:38:03.125 --> 00:38:07.000
Even if you don't understand now,
you'll understand soon.

00:38:07.208 --> 00:38:11.333
Where's Takeichi...? Let me see him!

00:38:11.542 --> 00:38:15.167
Atsugi, are you sure this is all right?

00:38:15.375 --> 00:38:20.417
Yes. We have a squad standing by
in case anything happens.

00:38:31.083 --> 00:38:34.917
"June 8, S 111 / 05:27 / Odaiba / Male"

00:38:38.750 --> 00:38:42.583
This is... Takeichi...?

00:38:42.792 --> 00:38:45.125
It can't be...

00:38:45.333 --> 00:38:49.500
Do you know about the four great revolutions
in medical treatment, GRMP?

00:38:49.708 --> 00:38:55.208
Genetic manipulation, regeneration,
nanomachines, and panaceas--

00:38:55.417 --> 00:38:58.625
Each of the letters in GRMP
represents one of these.

00:38:58.833 --> 00:39:02.083
All of these are controlled
by S.H.E.L.L.'s network.

00:39:02.292 --> 00:39:04.542
Of course I know that!

00:39:04.750 --> 00:39:06.083
Why...

00:39:06.292 --> 00:39:09.833
Why would a human end up like this?

00:39:10.042 --> 00:39:12.125
It's the Lost phenomenon.

00:39:12.333 --> 00:39:14.167
When someone loses contact with the network,

00:39:14.375 --> 00:39:17.792
the GRMPs inside them lose their
standards and go out of control.

00:39:18.000 --> 00:39:20.167
They don't die...?

00:39:20.375 --> 00:39:22.125
This hasn't been made public,

00:39:22.333 --> 00:39:25.667
but most of them end up deviating from
the boundaries of their physical bodies

00:39:25.875 --> 00:39:28.250
and become disfigured like this.

00:39:31.708 --> 00:39:33.625
He left this behind.

00:39:33.833 --> 00:39:35.458
| wonder what it's a picture of...

00:39:35.667 --> 00:39:37.208
A hell horse...

00:39:37.417 --> 00:39:38.208
Huh?

00:39:38.417 --> 00:39:40.958
It's the first painting I did.

00:39:41.167 --> 00:39:44.250
Takeichi praised it...

00:39:44.458 --> 00:39:48.125
Takeichi said he would take himself back.

00:39:48.333 --> 00:39:50.917
Is that what this is...?

00:39:51.125 --> 00:39:54.250
If that's the case, then he really is a fool...

00:39:58.292 --> 00:40:01.417
This is only supposed to happen
in extremely rare cases.

00:40:01.625 --> 00:40:06.625
| believe the cause is the anti-GRMP drugs
that Masao Horiki was handing out.

00:40:06.833 --> 00:40:09.500
Masao... Horiki...

00:40:11.333 --> 00:40:14.500
Are you saying that this is Mr. Masao's doing?!

00:40:14.708 --> 00:40:15.958
Why would he do this?

00:40:16.167 --> 00:40:19.500
To destroy the S.H.E.L.L. system.

00:40:19.708 --> 00:40:23.125
Him? No way.

00:40:23.333 --> 00:40:25.750
Horiki is the only one capable
of creating a nanomachine blocker

00:40:25.958 --> 00:40:29.417
that not even those
at S.H.E.L.L. HQ can parse.

00:40:29.625 --> 00:40:35.417
We must protect the citizens from
Horiki and the Lost phenomenon.

00:40:35.625 --> 00:40:38.875
We need you, Yozo.

00:40:41.208 --> 00:40:45.833
This is crazy... All of it...

00:40:50.958 --> 00:40:57.208
Fine, if you'll let me go home,
then I'll do whatever you want.

00:40:59.708 --> 00:41:01.875
This is to get Oba to cooperate with us.

00:41:02.083 --> 00:41:04.792
There's too much risk involved
if we release him.

00:41:05.000 --> 00:41:06.958
Horiki will attempt to contact him.

00:41:07.167 --> 00:41:09.875
That's why I'm sending your team as guards.

00:41:10.083 --> 00:41:12.875
In fact, this could be a chance to catch Horiki.

00:41:13.083 --> 00:41:16.792
More importantly, why don't you hurry up and
recognize Yoshiko and him as Qualified

00:41:17.000 --> 00:41:18.958
and add them to the health standard?

00:41:19.167 --> 00:41:21.458
That is what the Qualified wish as well.

00:41:21.667 --> 00:41:23.417
But we don't know what effect they will have.

00:41:23.625 --> 00:41:25.417
We must proceed carefully.

00:41:25.625 --> 00:41:29.375
Do those old people intend to avoid
coming to a conclusion?

00:41:29.583 --> 00:41:33.292
What is our job? Is it to just
maintain the status quo?

00:41:33.500 --> 00:41:35.750
Are you saying we should be resigned
to wait until civilization is destroyed?

00:41:35.958 --> 00:41:38.292
Time is limited even for them.

00:41:38.500 --> 00:41:43.542
Of the 330 original Qualified,
there are only 108 left.

00:41:43.750 --> 00:41:45.833
Our first priority is their life span--

00:41:46.042 --> 00:41:47.417
| will accompany him.

00:41:47.625 --> 00:41:48.375
Yoshiko...

00:41:48.583 --> 00:41:49.583
It'll be fine.

00:41:49.792 --> 00:41:55.042
| will prove that Mr. Oba is the man
who will restore civilization.

00:42:12.542 --> 00:42:15.667
We just took off.
We'll be following you two.

00:42:15.875 --> 00:42:17.958
No problems here.

00:42:18.167 --> 00:42:21.333
There's also the possibility that Oba
will initiate contact with Horiki.

00:42:21.542 --> 00:42:24.208
Activate the search system just in case.

00:42:24.417 --> 00:42:27.500
It might be pointless since we're
up against Horiki, though.

00:42:27.708 --> 00:42:29.167
Thank you very much.

00:42:29.375 --> 00:42:30.500
One more thing.

00:42:30.708 --> 00:42:31.958
Yes, sir?

00:42:32.167 --> 00:42:35.125
Don't brood too much and rush into anything...

00:42:36.250 --> 00:42:37.958
I'll be fine.

00:42:56.292 --> 00:43:00.208
The incident with Takeichi
was treated as an accident.

00:43:00.417 --> 00:43:04.458
Your rampage will also
not be considered a crime.

00:43:04.667 --> 00:43:07.417
You people can hide anything, huh...

00:43:16.542 --> 00:43:18.792
We have left the Inside. From here--

00:43:19.000 --> 00:43:21.292
...we enter the world of the poor.

00:43:22.083 --> 00:43:26.042
| am truly grateful for your cooperation.

00:43:26.250 --> 00:43:29.542
| am aware of the incomplete nature
of the S.H.E.L.L. system.

00:43:29.750 --> 00:43:36.333
The environment isn't perfect, and I know
that there are many who suffer in poverty.

00:43:36.542 --> 00:43:41.833
But I believe that someday, we can create a
society where everyone is healthy and happy,

00:43:42.042 --> 00:43:46.500
where we won't have casualties
like Takeichi anymore.

00:43:46.708 --> 00:43:49.000
| see. It's you.

00:43:49.208 --> 00:43:50.125
Me?

00:43:50.333 --> 00:43:55.042
You're that Yoshiko Hiiragi
| see on TV all the time.

00:43:55.250 --> 00:43:58.417
Yes. I also work as a public relations officer.

00:43:58.625 --> 00:44:01.542
Why are you trying so hard?

00:44:01.750 --> 00:44:03.250
What do you mean?

00:44:03.458 --> 00:44:08.167
Do you want to make us livestock
that can't die on our own that badly?

00:44:08.375 --> 00:44:12.542
| want to restore this civilization
that may be destroyed

00:44:12.750 --> 00:44:14.458
if we stay on the path we're on now.

00:44:14.667 --> 00:44:18.875
Basically, you just need
Masao Horiki to disappear, right?

00:44:19.875 --> 00:44:21.792
That's fine.

00:44:22.000 --> 00:44:23.833
I'll do it for you.

00:44:34.917 --> 00:44:37.792
--Yozy!
--Yozy!

00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:40.792
Hey, I was so worried about you!

00:44:41.000 --> 00:44:42.333
| saw the news, and--

00:44:42.542 --> 00:44:44.458
I'm fine.

00:44:45.667 --> 00:44:47.583
Did Mr. Masao come?

00:44:47.792 --> 00:44:50.083
He did the morning after.

00:44:50.292 --> 00:44:53.542
He said that you and Takeichi
were in a bad accident.

00:44:53.750 --> 00:44:55.667
Wait here.

00:45:08.625 --> 00:45:11.875
Where'd you get those clothes?
You look handsome.

00:45:13.792 --> 00:45:14.500
I'm going to change.

00:45:14.708 --> 00:45:18.333
What? I just said you look handsome.

00:45:18.542 --> 00:45:20.375
--Could you be...?

00:45:20.375 --> 00:45:22.000
--Hey! Hey!
--Could you be...?

00:45:23.417 --> 00:45:26.000
I'm Yoshiko Hiiragi from S.H.E.L.L.

00:45:26.208 --> 00:45:28.708
Did Yozy cause trouble for you?

00:45:28.917 --> 00:45:30.417
No, that's not it.

00:45:30.625 --> 00:45:32.458
Madam!

00:45:32.667 --> 00:45:37.417
Yozy's body's fixed!
There's not a single cut!

00:45:37.625 --> 00:45:39.208
We'd heard that it was a bad accident,

00:45:39.417 --> 00:45:42.542
so we were worried that
not even S.H.E.L.L. could heal him.

00:45:42.750 --> 00:45:44.375
There's no need to worry.

00:45:44.583 --> 00:45:46.792
Mr. Oba is the picture of health.

00:45:47.000 --> 00:45:50.250
| see... We must be grateful
to S.H.E.L.L., then.

00:45:50.458 --> 00:45:54.875
Anyway, I appreciate you
bringing him back safely to us.

00:45:55.083 --> 00:45:56.750
Thanks.

00:45:56.958 --> 00:46:00.000
Um, there's something
I'd like to talk to you about...

00:46:00.208 --> 00:46:01.667
Hey...

00:46:03.125 --> 00:46:05.542
Yozy, we're going to borrow your room.

00:46:05.750 --> 00:46:08.667
It sounds like she wants to talk with me alone.

00:46:13.792 --> 00:46:14.958
Sorry about this.

00:46:15.167 --> 00:46:17.500
This is the only room we've got.

00:46:19.083 --> 00:46:21.417
Isn't it a mess?

00:46:21.625 --> 00:46:24.083
| even cleaned up a bit already.

00:46:26.125 --> 00:46:28.333
Come, have a seat.

00:46:28.542 --> 00:46:30.375
Thank you.

00:46:33.417 --> 00:46:36.542
Now, what did you want to talk about?

00:46:36.750 --> 00:46:41.500
I'm sorry if this is rude, but may I ask
if you are a relative of Yozo Oba's?

00:46:41.708 --> 00:46:44.792
I'm kind of like his landlady...

00:46:45.000 --> 00:46:46.708
Yozy doesn't have any family.

00:46:46.917 --> 00:46:49.458
At least, that's what he says.

00:46:49.667 --> 00:46:55.083
We are thinking of bringing in Yozo Oba
as an agent of S.H.E.L.L.

00:46:55.292 --> 00:46:57.125
That's why I was hoping to meet his family...

00:46:57.333 --> 00:46:59.042
That's very sudden.

00:46:59.250 --> 00:47:00.583
Everything is highly confidential,

00:47:00.792 --> 00:47:04.500
so I apologize for not being able
to give you more details...

00:47:06.750 --> 00:47:10.417
Oh, I wouldn't understand
even if you explained it to me.

00:47:10.625 --> 00:47:13.333
If you came all this way with him,

00:47:13.542 --> 00:47:17.042
then it must mean that he is causing you
some kind of trouble, isn't he?

00:47:17.250 --> 00:47:20.000
Like I said before, that's not...

00:47:24.292 --> 00:47:29.542
The Yozy I know is an honest and good boy.

00:47:29.750 --> 00:47:32.000
His father was the good-for-nothing.

00:47:32.208 --> 00:47:35.833
Apparently, he abandoned Yozy
as a child and disappeared.

00:47:36.042 --> 00:47:37.792
| see...

00:47:38.000 --> 00:47:40.917
Even after he reached an age where
he could survive without parents,

00:47:41.125 --> 00:47:44.083
he would just paint all day long.

00:47:44.292 --> 00:47:46.333
Takeichi was his only friend.

00:47:46.542 --> 00:47:48.458
He's a strange kid, isn't he?

00:47:48.667 --> 00:47:53.375
But... he was searching for a place
to belong in his own way.

00:47:53.583 --> 00:47:55.042
He painted...?

00:47:55.250 --> 00:47:58.750
All the paintings in the bar are by him.

00:47:58.958 --> 00:48:00.542
You think it's weird, don't you?

00:48:00.750 --> 00:48:03.667
To let him paint me naked at my age...

00:48:03.875 --> 00:48:05.542
No, I don't.

00:48:05.750 --> 00:48:08.125
I'm glad I let him paint me.

00:48:08.333 --> 00:48:10.500
It might seem like a disqualification

00:48:10.708 --> 00:48:13.500
to the people who made
the Qualification Ceremony, though.

00:48:13.708 --> 00:48:17.792
But who's to know what
"qualified" means, anyway?

00:48:18.000 --> 00:48:24.083
Both beauty and happiness are different
depending on the person, right?

00:48:24.292 --> 00:48:28.208
Oh, I'm sorry. You work for S.H.E.L.L., right?

00:48:28.417 --> 00:48:32.292
| believe that the health and
long life provided by S.H.E.L.L.

00:48:32.500 --> 00:48:35.375
are things everyone believes we must protect.

00:48:35.583 --> 00:48:40.292
You're a genius at believing
in things, aren't you?

00:48:42.667 --> 00:48:46.875
I'm sorry, but it's not my place
to say anything.

00:48:47.083 --> 00:48:51.417
If Yozy wants to do something,
then I think he'll do it.

00:48:51.625 --> 00:48:57.583
Then we officially take charge
of Mr. Yozo Oba's person.

00:49:00.708 --> 00:49:03.667
You should have Yozy paint you, too.

00:49:03.875 --> 00:49:05.958
While you're still beautiful.

00:49:06.167 --> 00:49:08.167
Thank you for your time.

00:49:10.542 --> 00:49:11.708
Where's Mr. Oba?

00:49:11.917 --> 00:49:14.167
He went off somewhere.

00:49:15.542 --> 00:49:19.083
Madam, Yozy dumped me.

00:49:19.292 --> 00:49:21.750
Maybe I'll drink this and die.

00:49:28.542 --> 00:49:32.917
This individual is the only one with increased
levels of pulmonary macrophage activity.

00:49:36.750 --> 00:49:38.958
Mr. Atsugi, Mr. Oba has escaped.

00:49:39.167 --> 00:49:41.833
It was when I took my eyes off
of him... I'm very sorry!

00:49:42.042 --> 00:49:43.208
Do you know his position?

00:49:43.417 --> 00:49:44.333
Approximately, yes.

00:49:44.542 --> 00:49:46.708
Go after him immediately. I'll follow you.

00:49:46.917 --> 00:49:48.292
Roger.

00:49:48.583 --> 00:49:55.750
"Mind Your Own Business"

00:49:58.417 --> 00:50:00.708
| don't feel winded...?

00:50:29.125 --> 00:50:32.667
Why are you here...?

00:50:37.917 --> 00:50:43.292
| can access the separate network
that a Lost is on.

00:50:43.500 --> 00:50:47.083
| just followed your shadow
after you left S.H.E.L.L.

00:50:47.292 --> 00:50:48.792
Come with me.

00:50:59.500 --> 00:51:02.833
Don't you think this is a strange sight?

00:51:03.042 --> 00:51:06.167
Most of the happiness felt
by the people of this country

00:51:06.375 --> 00:51:10.083
is a result of S.H.E.L.L.
manipulating their brain matter.

00:51:10.292 --> 00:51:13.042
But there are those who refuse that...

00:51:13.250 --> 00:51:15.583
Like you and Takeichi.

00:51:16.792 --> 00:51:18.292
Where are we?

00:51:18.500 --> 00:51:20.500
It's where I work.

00:51:23.375 --> 00:51:27.208
Once you become an Applicant,
tricks like this become possible.

00:51:27.417 --> 00:51:30.375
Adapting to polluted air is similar.

00:51:30.583 --> 00:51:32.167
Don't forget.

00:51:36.042 --> 00:51:37.833
He's gone underground.

00:51:42.958 --> 00:51:43.958
Flowers...?

00:51:44.167 --> 00:51:47.000
The purified air sent by S.H.E.L.L.
has drugs to boost growth hormone in it.

00:51:47.208 --> 00:51:50.333
Thanks to that, they grow very well.

00:51:50.542 --> 00:51:56.708
From poppy resin and my own blood,
| make anti-GRMP drugs.

00:51:56.917 --> 00:52:03.958
| make use of the mechanism
of how poppy affects the brain.

00:52:04.167 --> 00:52:08.625
Why... did you turn Takeichi into a monster?

00:52:08.833 --> 00:52:12.875
The people who were trying to create
eternal youth and long life did it.

00:52:13.083 --> 00:52:16.333
| regret my participation in that.

00:52:16.542 --> 00:52:18.125
Participation?

00:52:18.333 --> 00:52:22.083
| was the last doctor
in this country, you know.

00:52:22.292 --> 00:52:26.083
| worked desperately for those
revolutions in medical treatment.

00:52:26.292 --> 00:52:33.583
And then, I created that merciless
life-support system, S.H.E.L.L.

00:52:34.500 --> 00:52:37.417
You... created it...?

00:52:37.625 --> 00:52:41.958
The Lost form is our true form.

00:52:42.167 --> 00:52:45.250
Did you not learn that from Yoshiko Hiiragi?

00:52:45.458 --> 00:52:48.458
She said there were people
who could die normally, too...

00:52:48.667 --> 00:52:51.542
S.H.E.L.L. is just holding back
the change forcibly.

00:52:51.750 --> 00:52:55.292
We're being forced to stay human.

00:52:55.500 --> 00:52:58.250
Takeichi could feel that oppression.

00:52:58.458 --> 00:53:01.375
Are you trying to say
that Takeichi wanted it?

00:53:01.583 --> 00:53:04.542
Returning to being
a true human in order to die.

00:53:04.750 --> 00:53:07.292
His wish was granted.

00:53:07.500 --> 00:53:11.750
Anyway, you're the one who killed him.

00:53:11.958 --> 00:53:14.292
How can you say that?!

00:53:16.833 --> 00:53:20.542
Takeichi was my friend!

00:53:22.500 --> 00:53:24.125
Even if I weren't an Applicant,

00:53:24.333 --> 00:53:27.667
there isn't a single person who would
die from a wound like this now.

00:53:29.333 --> 00:53:36.292
Your anger... and your pride...
were all made meaningless by S.H.E.L.L.

00:53:39.625 --> 00:53:40.792
We don't have much time.

00:53:41.000 --> 00:53:43.250
There's something I want to show you.

00:53:45.583 --> 00:53:46.417
Underground?

00:53:46.625 --> 00:53:48.417
Yes, there's no doubt about it.

00:53:48.625 --> 00:53:50.292
I'll share the image with you.

00:53:51.542 --> 00:53:54.208
Confirmed. It's Oimatsu Area.

00:53:54.417 --> 00:53:57.417
That area is abandoned, though.
There shouldn't be anything there.

00:53:57.625 --> 00:54:00.208
| sense a change in Mr. Oba's vitals.

00:54:00.417 --> 00:54:04.000
Increased pulse and blood pressure.
Oxidization of dopamine.

00:54:04.208 --> 00:54:06.833
Increased synthesis of noradrenaline.

00:54:07.042 --> 00:54:08.417
Anger...

00:54:08.625 --> 00:54:09.833
...and fear.

00:54:10.042 --> 00:54:12.042
Horiki is with him.

00:54:15.083 --> 00:54:16.542
It's a large ventilation duct!

00:54:16.750 --> 00:54:17.625
| see it.

00:54:17.833 --> 00:54:20.750
To all troops: It appears that Yozo
Oba and Masao Horiki are inside

00:54:20.958 --> 00:54:23.083
the ventilation duct in Nogeyama Park!

00:54:23.292 --> 00:54:27.833
Fourth dispatch, prepare
to descend to capture Horiki!

00:54:28.042 --> 00:54:30.542
Do you know what this is?

00:54:30.750 --> 00:54:33.375
This is the Civilization Bringing Curve
that uses all the vitals and data

00:54:33.583 --> 00:54:37.417
of everyone in the country
to predict the future of society.

00:54:37.625 --> 00:54:41.833
Those people at S.H.E.L.L. worship this
as if it were Buddha himself.

00:54:42.042 --> 00:54:46.167
Applicants are beings that rank higher
than S.H.E.L.L., so to speak.

00:54:46.375 --> 00:54:48.750
When I accessed this set of big data,

00:54:48.958 --> 00:54:51.458
a certain image was generated.

00:54:51.667 --> 00:54:55.083
I'm going to link your network
to mine right now.

00:54:55.292 --> 00:54:56.958
Don't struggle.

00:55:05.542 --> 00:55:10.000
This is the future
this world is heading toward.

00:55:10.208 --> 00:55:12.958
Eventually, the life spans of
the Qualified will reach their end,

00:55:13.167 --> 00:55:16.167
and all the citizens of this country
will become Lost.

00:55:17.417 --> 00:55:20.458
Yozo. Humans have become disqualified

00:55:20.667 --> 00:55:26.000
going up against a social system
that has become too advanced.

00:55:26.208 --> 00:55:28.667
Disqualified...?

00:55:37.583 --> 00:55:40.375
The research I devoted my life to

00:55:40.583 --> 00:55:44.833
only served to put the nail
in the coffin of human dignity...

00:55:45.042 --> 00:55:50.542
Inside that coffin, humans pray for
an end to come to their suffering.

00:55:50.750 --> 00:55:58.000
It is my duty to put an end to it,
and as the world's last doctor, it is my job.

00:55:58.208 --> 00:56:03.208
If S.H.E.L.L. is not destroyed,
then this living hell will not end.

00:56:03.417 --> 00:56:07.708
Those greedy old people
will make you into a sacrifice.

00:56:07.917 --> 00:56:10.208
Leave that aside and come with me.

00:56:10.417 --> 00:56:12.708
The two of us will embrace the destruction

00:56:12.917 --> 00:56:14.583
and make mankind start again from scratch.

00:56:14.792 --> 00:56:17.542
No... Stop it...

00:56:17.750 --> 00:56:20.208
This has nothing to do with me!

00:56:20.417 --> 00:56:23.208
Then, what do you want?

00:56:23.417 --> 00:56:25.875
If you make a mistake in your future course,

00:56:26.083 --> 00:56:29.333
then you will draw to yourself
an unwanted future.

00:56:34.458 --> 00:56:36.708
An unwanted future?

00:56:37.833 --> 00:56:39.292
Don't tell me...

00:56:56.750 --> 00:57:03.333
Yozy... Call S.H.E.L.L...

00:57:03.542 --> 00:57:06.042
Tsune's...

00:57:09.208 --> 00:57:11.125
Please, stop!

00:57:22.208 --> 00:57:24.250
Yozy...

00:57:45.083 --> 00:57:47.833
That's right, Yozo.

00:57:48.042 --> 00:57:50.333
That's the way to do it.

00:57:52.875 --> 00:57:56.167
There was all this commotion
even though you were with him?

00:57:56.375 --> 00:57:58.000
It was a disgrace.

00:57:58.208 --> 00:58:02.083
But with this, we can be sure
that Oba won't work with Horiki.

00:58:02.292 --> 00:58:06.042
And to borrow Yoshiko's words, Oba's evolving.

00:58:06.250 --> 00:58:07.833
That is impossible to determine.

00:58:08.042 --> 00:58:11.083
We compared samples
from Yoshiko and Yozo Oba,

00:58:11.292 --> 00:58:15.250
but other than the fact that all 19 types
of their amino acids are L-form,

00:58:15.458 --> 00:58:17.625
they were completely different.

00:58:17.833 --> 00:58:21.542
Is Yoshiko's sensing ability all we can rely on?

00:58:21.750 --> 00:58:25.792
We keep adding to her burden.

00:58:26.000 --> 00:58:29.500
When I think about everything
we've done to her until now...

00:58:30.500 --> 00:58:33.500
One experiment after another...

00:58:33.708 --> 00:58:38.042
A cruel fate, but no one else
could shoulder that burden for her.

00:58:38.250 --> 00:58:40.833
It will be the same for Yozo Oba. No--

00:58:41.042 --> 00:58:46.042
Perhaps it will be the same
for all the citizens of this country.

00:58:50.208 --> 00:58:51.458
Yozo!

00:58:53.792 --> 00:58:56.083
|I won't go to H.I.L. A. M.

00:58:57.375 --> 00:59:01.875
Masao said that I would draw
an unwanted future to myself.

00:59:02.083 --> 00:59:08.000
He showed me my nightmare,
calling it a vision of destruction...

00:59:08.208 --> 00:59:10.458
A vision of destruction...

00:59:10.667 --> 00:59:17.917
Madam's death... is also probably
my fault, like he said...

00:59:18.125 --> 00:59:21.667
| am truly sorry about what happened to them.

00:59:21.875 --> 00:59:24.542
It was our fault for not following up properly.

00:59:24.750 --> 00:59:30.000
Please, give me just one more chance.

00:59:40.375 --> 00:59:43.375
"Yoshiko Hiiragi"

00:59:53.500 --> 00:59:56.000
When S.H.E.L.L. was in its early stages,

00:59:56.208 --> 00:59:59.417
they used this old radio tower
to start their research.

00:59:59.625 --> 01:00:03.083
In the past, I was also brought here often.

01:00:03.292 --> 01:00:05.000
What are we going to do?

01:00:05.208 --> 01:00:07.042
| want you to see something.

01:00:07.250 --> 01:00:09.917
A different vision from Masao Horiki's.

01:00:11.375 --> 01:00:15.167
But before that, I will tell you about myself.

01:00:15.375 --> 01:00:17.500
About you?

01:00:17.708 --> 01:00:22.375
You asked me why I was
trying so hard, didn't you?

01:00:22.583 --> 01:00:24.875
I will tell you.

01:00:26.417 --> 01:00:30.583
| also died once.

01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:34.583
The one who killed me...

01:00:34.792 --> 01:00:36.500
...was my father.

01:00:41.167 --> 01:00:47.958
All I remember is that at one point,
he suddenly said, "I feel like I could die now."

01:00:57.000 --> 01:00:59.292
In the midst of the Lost phenomenon,

01:00:59.500 --> 01:01:02.750
| could see my father's heart,
which was disappearing.

01:01:05.333 --> 01:01:07.250
And then,

01:01:07.458 --> 01:01:11.500
as I desperately tried to save him,

01:01:11.708 --> 01:01:16.625
he was able to leave this world as a human.

01:01:17.917 --> 01:01:21.292
That was my power.

01:01:21.500 --> 01:01:24.292
After that, I was put under
the care of H.I.L.A.M.,

01:01:24.500 --> 01:01:26.083
and since then,

01:01:26.292 --> 01:01:30.625
I've watched over the hearts of all
the people whose hearts are disappearing.

01:01:37.708 --> 01:01:39.250
Yozo...

01:01:40.625 --> 01:01:42.875
| remember now...

01:01:43.083 --> 01:01:44.917
Why...?

01:01:45.125 --> 01:01:48.542
I'd forgotten about it all this time...

01:01:48.750 --> 01:01:52.375
When I was little... my dad told me...

01:01:53.958 --> 01:01:55.667
...t-to smile...

01:01:57.375 --> 01:01:59.875
But I couldn't smile properly...

01:02:00.083 --> 01:02:06.583
And then, he changed before my eyes...

01:02:08.292 --> 01:02:11.625
My whole family...

01:02:11.833 --> 01:02:15.792
...was eaten by the thing that was my dad...!

01:02:17.708 --> 01:02:19.833
| wanted to smile...

01:02:22.042 --> 01:02:23.958
...but I couldn't...

01:02:30.083 --> 01:02:31.500
With these hands...

01:02:31.708 --> 01:02:33.500
...I killed my dad...

01:02:35.792 --> 01:02:39.708
...who had turned into a monster!

01:02:39.917 --> 01:02:41.625
--Yozo!
-- I killed him!

01:02:41.833 --> 01:02:47.583
You're closing yourself off with that guilt!

01:02:47.792 --> 01:02:49.583
I'm the one who killed him!

01:02:49.792 --> 01:02:51.333
But--

01:02:54.792 --> 01:02:57.583
All you can do is move on!

01:03:01.750 --> 01:03:03.792
Believe...

01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:06.167
...in the future!

01:03:15.583 --> 01:03:17.208
The sky...

01:03:18.417 --> 01:03:19.875
...is so blue.

01:03:21.792 --> 01:03:25.042
It is a vision of
the restoration of civilization.

01:03:25.250 --> 01:03:29.583
Right now, this is what I live for.

01:03:29.792 --> 01:03:31.958
This blue sky...

01:03:33.875 --> 01:03:36.958
...is our future...

01:04:20.542 --> 01:04:23.167
You are, as I thought...

01:04:23.375 --> 01:04:26.000
You're doing better than I thought you'd be.

01:04:31.375 --> 01:04:33.667
Yoshiko Hiiragi, I presume?

01:04:33.875 --> 01:04:36.625
Masao... Horiki.

01:04:36.833 --> 01:04:38.958
| came to extend my invitation again.

01:04:39.167 --> 01:04:43.125
| will make all the citizens Lost
and crush S.H.E.L.L.

01:04:43.333 --> 01:04:47.792
And then, I will give birth to a new
mankind using the backup genes.

01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:51.542
That is the only way to get back
the world of humans.

01:04:51.750 --> 01:04:56.625
Before new life is born, you will just be
destroyed along with this civilization!

01:04:58.708 --> 01:05:01.208
That girl is nothing more
than an unfortunate guinea pig

01:05:01.417 --> 01:05:04.083
being used by the old people.

01:05:04.292 --> 01:05:07.167
The future she believes in is a delusion.

01:05:07.375 --> 01:05:08.917
Think about it.

01:05:09.125 --> 01:05:13.167
S.H.E.L.L. can't recognize Applicants as human.

01:05:13.375 --> 01:05:15.250
So then how can they say definitively

01:05:15.458 --> 01:05:19.500
that the Civilization Bringing Curve
is what they wish for?

01:05:21.875 --> 01:05:26.000
| believe her, Masao.

01:05:33.375 --> 01:05:34.708
Yozo!

01:05:52.458 --> 01:05:53.833
Fire!

01:06:09.042 --> 01:06:13.417
You've been trained well, Yoshiko Hiiragi.

01:06:39.583 --> 01:06:40.875
Yozo.

01:06:41.083 --> 01:06:44.083
Hand over your heart.

01:06:56.375 --> 01:06:58.125
Did you forget?

01:06:58.333 --> 01:07:01.875
Manipulating the Lost is my power.

01:07:04.708 --> 01:07:06.333
Stop!

01:07:09.333 --> 01:07:13.167
This is what I needed.

01:07:14.083 --> 01:07:16.125
Good boy, Yozo.

01:07:16.333 --> 01:07:18.583
Now, tear that woman apart.

01:07:18.792 --> 01:07:21.042
Like you did to Takeichi.

01:07:49.125 --> 01:07:50.417
Oh?

01:07:50.625 --> 01:07:52.167
Don't resist.

01:07:52.375 --> 01:07:54.542
You are my Orpheus.

01:07:54.750 --> 01:07:56.875
Kill that woman.

01:07:57.083 --> 01:07:59.917
Yozo! Don't listen to his voice!

01:08:00.125 --> 01:08:03.167
Don't get in my way, guinea pig!

01:08:05.167 --> 01:08:08.125
Horiki!

01:08:17.875 --> 01:08:19.458
| won't let you get away!

01:08:19.667 --> 01:08:21.125
You're getting old.

01:08:21.333 --> 01:08:25.875
Are you okay with your princess
getting ripped apart?

01:08:34.125 --> 01:08:35.500
Yoshiko!

01:08:43.333 --> 01:08:45.167
Tell your owner

01:08:45.375 --> 01:08:47.708
that the time has come.

01:09:20.500 --> 01:09:22.208
No...!

01:10:01.250 --> 01:10:04.458
It's finally complete, Shizuko.

01:10:05.667 --> 01:10:08.542
Decades of trial and error

01:10:08.750 --> 01:10:12.375
finished in an instant, thanks to Yozo.

01:10:12.583 --> 01:10:15.792
Maybe that's what life is like.

01:10:16.000 --> 01:10:19.167
Honestly, I was jealous.

01:10:21.208 --> 01:10:25.000
Look at this. My wound won't regenerate.

01:10:31.375 --> 01:10:34.750
It looks like even Applicants
have a limit to their life spans.

01:10:34.958 --> 01:10:39.875
That's why this unsightly way
was the only method left to me.

01:10:43.042 --> 01:10:46.708
I'm prepared to go to hell...

01:10:46.917 --> 01:10:50.833
No, there's no hell worse than this...

01:11:08.875 --> 01:11:11.250
Sleep well...

01:11:11.458 --> 01:11:13.333
...Shizuko.

01:11:17.833 --> 01:11:21.208
"The Third Notebook"

01:11:30.833 --> 01:11:34.208
His heart muscle has regenerated...

01:11:37.250 --> 01:11:39.333
...but I can't see his spirit.

01:11:39.958 --> 01:11:42.167
"1 day until the Qualification Ceremony"

01:11:42.167 --> 01:11:44.458
"1 day until the Qualification Ceremony" It's
finally time for the Qualification Ceremony, huh?

01:11:44.458 --> 01:11:44.625
It's finally time for
the Qualification Ceremony, huh?

01:11:46.042 --> 01:11:49.750
| need to bring Yozo over there...

01:11:49.958 --> 01:11:52.667
You successfully lured Horiki there.

01:11:52.875 --> 01:11:55.583
The one who got flustered
and made a mistake was me.

01:11:55.792 --> 01:11:58.417
Your hunch was correct.

01:11:58.625 --> 01:12:02.208
Yes... Everything was
wrapped up in the blue sky...

01:12:02.417 --> 01:12:07.125
At that moment, the third curve
fused with the restoration curve.

01:12:07.333 --> 01:12:12.333
Thanks to that, even that chief seemed to
be willing to talk directly to the Qualified.

01:12:12.542 --> 01:12:16.083
The problem is Masao Horiki.

01:12:16.292 --> 01:12:21.292
Yes. He is likely to come and try
to destroy S.H.E.L.L. himself,

01:12:21.500 --> 01:12:23.167
matching his timing to
the Qualification Ceremony.

01:12:23.167 --> 01:12:23.958
<i>"Congrats Long Life" "Health and Long Life" "Congrats
Qualified" matching his timing to the Qualification Ceremony.</i>

01:12:23.958 --> 01:12:24.167
"Congrats Long Life" "Health
and Long Life" "Congrats Qualified"

01:12:24.167 --> 01:12:29.542
<i>"Congrats Long Life" "Health and Long Life" "Congrats Qualified" Even
if we're in a state of high alert, if he's our opponent, we can't relax.</i>

01:12:29.542 --> 01:12:29.750
"Congrats Long Life" "Health
and Long Life" "Congrats Qualified"

01:12:29.750 --> 01:12:30.583
<i>"Congrats Long Life" "Health and Long
Life" "Congrats Qualified" About Oba...</i>

01:12:30.583 --> 01:12:30.792
"Congrats Long Life" "Health
and Long Life" "Congrats Qualified"

01:12:30.792 --> 01:12:32.958
"Congrats Long Life™" "Health and Long Life™" "Congrats
Qualified"” | will increase the depth of my approach even more.

01:12:32.958 --> 01:12:33.167
"Congrats Long Life" "Health
and Long Life" "Congrats Qualified"

01:12:33.167 --> 01:12:34.625
"Congrats Long Life™" "Health and Long Life™"
"Congrats Qualified” It's not safe, you know.

01:12:34.625 --> 01:12:35.000
It's not safe, you know.

01:12:38.625 --> 01:12:42.167
Even if I make the wrong call
on Horiki, I will stop him.

01:12:43.458 --> 01:12:47.542
It appears Yozo Oba is not waking up.

01:12:47.750 --> 01:12:54.792
No, sir. Shibuta Agency is putting all
its energy into awakening him.

01:12:55.000 --> 01:12:59.167
That's all you keep saying, huh?

01:12:59.375 --> 01:13:05.458
Wouldn't it have been hard to make
that man Qualified all along?

01:13:06.500 --> 01:13:09.042
The Qualification Ceremony is tomorrow.

01:13:09.250 --> 01:13:14.792
We need a plan B to ensure
the health and safety of the citizens.

01:13:15.000 --> 01:13:17.875
Plan B...? But...

01:13:18.083 --> 01:13:20.917
Even now, in efforts centered
around Yoshiko Hiiragi,

01:13:21.125 --> 01:13:24.958
we are taking measures to link to Oba's ego.

01:13:25.167 --> 01:13:27.500
The restoration projection of
the Civilization Bringing Curve

01:13:27.708 --> 01:13:30.708
is without a doubt because of Obal!

01:13:31.750 --> 01:13:37.000
That might be related to how our numbers
have been decreasing every day

01:13:37.208 --> 01:13:40.458
since the appearance of the Third Applicant.

01:13:40.667 --> 01:13:46.708
Th-That's... something we need
more time to investigate...

01:13:46.917 --> 01:13:47.875
Shibuta.

01:13:48.083 --> 01:13:49.083
Yes, sir!

01:13:49.292 --> 01:13:52.583
Perhaps you do not fully understand...

01:13:52.792 --> 01:13:55.708
Just what do you think we are?

01:13:57.417 --> 01:14:02.708
We are those qualified to be
standards of health,

01:14:02.917 --> 01:14:06.917
here to guarantee the happiness
and health of the citizens.

01:14:07.125 --> 01:14:11.042
| fully... understand... the situation...

01:14:11.250 --> 01:14:16.708
There is not much time left to us...

01:14:16.917 --> 01:14:19.208
We're counting on you.

01:14:26.458 --> 01:14:28.917
A concrete image has appeared!

01:14:30.542 --> 01:14:33.875
Oba's vitals and the Civilization
Bringing Curve are both stable.

01:14:34.083 --> 01:14:35.375
Can you proceed?

01:14:35.583 --> 01:14:36.708
Of course.

01:14:36.917 --> 01:14:38.917
You'll be going into deep territory next.

01:14:39.125 --> 01:14:41.333
If we determine that you cannot
preserve your individuality,

01:14:41.542 --> 01:14:42.750
we will pull you out.

01:14:42.958 --> 01:14:44.292
Yes, sir.

01:14:51.833 --> 01:14:56.958
As expected, Yozo's spirit
is still trapped in "that day"...

01:15:03.375 --> 01:15:05.375
Yozo...

01:15:07.458 --> 01:15:09.167
He's accepting me.

01:15:09.375 --> 01:15:11.292
Yoshiko, it's me.

01:15:11.500 --> 01:15:12.750
Chief...?

01:15:12.958 --> 01:15:15.417
The experiment is suspended.

01:15:15.625 --> 01:15:19.042
Why? Mr. Oba isn't rejecting me.

01:15:19.250 --> 01:15:20.708
We're almost there!

01:15:20.917 --> 01:15:23.500
It has been decided...

01:15:23.708 --> 01:15:27.917
...that Yozo Oba's body will be
donated for the transplant.

01:15:28.875 --> 01:15:31.667
Yozo Oba has been determined brain-dead,

01:15:31.875 --> 01:15:36.125
and the plan is for him to join with
a Qualified through organ transplants.

01:15:36.333 --> 01:15:40.208
We will use his superior cell levels
as the Third Applicant

01:15:40.417 --> 01:15:43.542
to overwrite the current health standard.

01:15:44.625 --> 01:15:46.208
This can't be...

01:15:47.833 --> 01:15:49.083
Refuse...

01:15:50.208 --> 01:15:52.083
| refuse...

01:16:02.583 --> 01:16:05.958
Yozo, smile.

01:16:08.167 --> 01:16:10.208
Smile!

01:16:12.208 --> 01:16:13.875
Smile.

01:16:14.083 --> 01:16:15.667
Shut up!

01:16:18.792 --> 01:16:23.000
Smile, Yozo.

01:16:25.125 --> 01:16:28.375
Why do I have to smile?!

01:16:34.958 --> 01:16:36.500
Yoshiko...!

01:16:41.958 --> 01:16:44.000
| finally reached you.

01:16:45.500 --> 01:16:49.000
| was trying to kill you again...

01:16:51.250 --> 01:16:57.042
Yozo. I wanted to see you one last time.

01:16:57.250 --> 01:16:59.208
Last...?

01:17:00.250 --> 01:17:04.667
Please, paint me.

01:17:06.500 --> 01:17:09.333
| can't paint you.

01:17:09.542 --> 01:17:14.208
I... I can't anymore...

01:17:15.583 --> 01:17:17.458
It's fine.

01:17:22.833 --> 01:17:27.625
You constantly believe
in yourself and in society.

01:17:27.833 --> 01:17:30.500
| was always jealous.

01:17:30.708 --> 01:17:35.250
I... just believed.

01:17:36.458 --> 01:17:41.792
By believing, I didn't have to look at myself.

01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:46.542
But it was all a lie.

01:17:46.750 --> 01:17:51.708
| was the only one bearing this vision
for decades and suffering...

01:17:51.917 --> 01:17:54.333
| came to understand that.

01:17:54.542 --> 01:17:59.042
When that happened, a pitch-black
emotion filled my chest...

01:18:00.792 --> 01:18:07.042
| have a heart, too.
It was the first time I felt that.

01:18:07.250 --> 01:18:10.833
That's why I will give it to you.

01:18:24.125 --> 01:18:26.083
Even so,

01:18:26.292 --> 01:18:28.583
your sky is blue...

01:18:29.708 --> 01:18:35.125
That's the last hope that you've given me.

01:18:39.542 --> 01:18:43.958
So that's what you look like when you smile.

01:18:55.125 --> 01:18:58.375
I'm waiting.

01:19:00.708 --> 01:19:05.083
I'll wait as long as it takes...

01:19:05.292 --> 01:19:07.333
...for the world that you will lead.

01:19:23.125 --> 01:19:24.708
Yoshiko!

01:19:28.458 --> 01:19:30.417
Are you awake?

01:19:33.875 --> 01:19:35.083
Where are you going?

01:19:35.292 --> 01:19:37.792
What did you do to Yoshiko?!

01:19:41.292 --> 01:19:44.667
Are you saying something
is happening to Yoshiko?

01:19:55.500 --> 01:20:01.750
Today is an auspicious day rarely
seen in the history of mankind.

01:20:01.958 --> 01:20:05.375
Thanks to S.H.E.L.L. and its Sound Health
and Everlasting Long Life system,

01:20:05.375 --> 01:20:06.958
"Congrats on 120 Years First Annual Qualification Ceremony" Thanks
to S.H.E.L.L. and its Sound Health and Everlasting Long Life system,

01:20:06.958 --> 01:20:07.167
"Congrats on 120 Years
First Annual Qualification Ceremony"

01:20:07.167 --> 01:20:12.583
"Congrats on 120 Years First Annual Qualification Ceremony" we are graced
by the presence of those who have lived the average natural life span

01:20:12.583 --> 01:20:12.792
"Congrats on 120 Years
First Annual Qualification Ceremony"

01:20:12.792 --> 01:20:18.167
"Congrats on 120 Years First Annual Qualification Ceremony"
of 120 years, and I am honored to speak before you all today.

01:20:18.167 --> 01:20:19.625
Of 120 years, and I am honored
to speak before you all today.

01:20:19.833 --> 01:20:23.542
Now, you will leave
the protection of S.H.E.L.L.

01:20:23.750 --> 01:20:29.917
and take responsibility for living
out the end of your lives.

01:20:30.125 --> 01:20:33.458
However, I believe that this means
this is also the opening ceremony

01:20:33.458 --> 01:20:34.292
"Congratulations on your 120th birthday!" However, I
believe that this means this is also the opening ceremony

01:20:34.292 --> 01:20:34.500
"Congratulations on your 120th birthday!"

01:20:34.500 --> 01:20:37.833
"Congratulations on your 120th birthday!" for each and
every one of you to realize your greatest achievements.

01:20:37.833 --> 01:20:42.167
For each and every one of you to realize
your greatest achievements.

01:20:43.917 --> 01:20:47.042
I'm grateful to you.

01:20:47.250 --> 01:20:49.542
With this and the pension,
I'll have 300 million.

01:20:49.750 --> 01:20:54.125
The family I leave behind will be
able to live on the Inside.

01:20:57.333 --> 01:21:03.292
Don't waste... our lives...

01:21:03.500 --> 01:21:08.292
...we were able to reinstate
the pension system.

01:21:08.500 --> 01:21:11.458
With the pension, each person...

01:21:11.667 --> 01:21:13.875
Have you awakened, Yozo?

01:21:14.083 --> 01:21:17.292
But you can't stop it anymore.

01:21:17.500 --> 01:21:20.292
Yoshiko! Don't go!

01:21:24.500 --> 01:21:26.833
Where is Yoshiko?!

01:21:29.417 --> 01:21:31.667
This day has finally come...

01:21:31.875 --> 01:21:33.667
What is going on?

01:21:33.875 --> 01:21:36.583
It was that girl's request...

01:21:36.792 --> 01:21:42.625
...to become the transplant
body donor in Yozo Oba's place.

01:21:42.833 --> 01:21:45.875
She said she would prolong
the lives of the old people,

01:21:46.083 --> 01:21:50.042
and asked me to awaken Oba as a Qualified.

01:21:54.375 --> 01:21:55.875
You bastard!

01:21:56.083 --> 01:22:01.000
Are you saying you gave Yoshiko
to those old people as an offering?!

01:22:01.208 --> 01:22:02.708
Can you so unconcernedly...

01:22:02.917 --> 01:22:07.708
...bury that girl's future... in darkness?!

01:22:30.125 --> 01:22:34.208
Yoshiko Hiiragi, are you ready?

01:22:34.417 --> 01:22:41.083
Yes. I offer this body to
the current world and to you all.

01:22:41.292 --> 01:22:46.375
My heart and spirit I offer
to the future and to Yozo.

01:22:46.583 --> 01:22:50.167
| see. Well, the sooner the better.

01:22:53.542 --> 01:22:55.458
Yoshiko! Yoshiko!

01:22:55.667 --> 01:22:57.333
Yoshiko!

01:22:58.917 --> 01:23:00.458
Damn it!

01:23:02.833 --> 01:23:05.667
Did you draw to yourself an unwanted future?

01:23:05.875 --> 01:23:10.458
This is all the result of your foolishness.

01:23:12.375 --> 01:23:16.833
The "death" you bring will drag others in...

01:23:17.042 --> 01:23:20.292
...by bringing about a chain of great regret.

01:23:21.833 --> 01:23:26.458
The greater the regret, the greater
the magnitude of the Lost phenomenon.

01:23:26.667 --> 01:23:27.667
This is your power--

01:23:27.875 --> 01:23:31.833
The power of you, who were born
as the Third Applicant--

01:23:32.042 --> 01:23:34.000
This is your fate.

01:23:34.208 --> 01:23:38.083
I will decide my own fate!

01:23:39.542 --> 01:23:42.583
Go ahead and try.

01:23:47.083 --> 01:23:49.208
The chief made these arrangements.

01:23:49.417 --> 01:23:50.667
Let's go.

01:24:53.000 --> 01:24:56.542
People who have had "life"
stolen along with "death"--

01:24:56.750 --> 01:25:01.083
This is the time for you to vent
your years of resentment!

01:25:40.542 --> 01:25:41.958
It's coming this way! Hurry, run!

01:25:42.167 --> 01:25:43.542
Right!

01:26:28.750 --> 01:26:30.875
Of the targets proceeding toward S.H.E.L.L.,

01:26:31.083 --> 01:26:34.833
we have confirmed a person
thought to be the First Applicant!

01:26:35.042 --> 01:26:36.250
Horiki...

01:26:36.458 --> 01:26:38.417
The target is passing the state guest house!

01:26:38.625 --> 01:26:40.417
All bullets are hitting their marks,
but there's no effect!

01:26:40.625 --> 01:26:41.583
We can't slow him down!

01:26:41.792 --> 01:26:44.875
We need reinforcements urgentl--!

01:26:49.000 --> 01:26:51.542
Yozo Oba...

01:26:51.750 --> 01:26:53.708
Please...

01:26:55.458 --> 01:26:58.167
...don't let Yoshiko's
determination go to waste.

01:27:14.958 --> 01:27:19.542
I'm waiting.

01:27:19.750 --> 01:27:23.375
I'll wait as long as it takes...

01:27:23.583 --> 01:27:26.833
...for the world that you will lead.

01:29:32.125 --> 01:29:35.417
It's as if the clock has been turned back...

01:29:35.625 --> 01:29:37.750
Was everyone successful?

01:29:37.958 --> 01:29:40.542
With this, we will be secure for the time being.

01:29:43.958 --> 01:29:46.083
How unsightly...

01:30:00.250 --> 01:30:02.208
Horiki...

01:30:02.417 --> 01:30:06.000
You're not breaking through to the core,
but you're breaking through here?

01:30:06.208 --> 01:30:10.417
The Lost phenomenon is
a fearsome thing, isn't it?

01:30:10.625 --> 01:30:15.417
Are you planning on forcing S.H.E.L.L. into
a double suicide with you with that power?

01:30:15.625 --> 01:30:20.958
This is only possible with the hatred
that I've built up over 120 years!

01:30:31.958 --> 01:30:33.167
Horiki...

01:30:33.375 --> 01:30:35.167
Don't tell me...

01:30:35.375 --> 01:30:38.667
On the splendid day of
the Qualification Ceremony,

01:30:38.875 --> 01:30:45.042
what are you trying to do by
creating something so boorish?

01:30:45.250 --> 01:30:49.917
We have joined with the Second Applicant

01:30:50.125 --> 01:30:53.833
and have acquired a new health standard.

01:30:54.042 --> 01:30:55.333
Look.

01:30:55.542 --> 01:31:01.958
The Civilization Bringing Curve
is also celebrating our long lives.

01:31:02.167 --> 01:31:05.625
The ecstasy and anxiety of the chosen ones--

01:31:05.833 --> 01:31:08.708
We experience both.

01:31:08.917 --> 01:31:11.000
We live.

01:31:11.208 --> 01:31:15.208
We continue living and driving civilization.

01:31:16.083 --> 01:31:19.292
You, when all you do is deny death?

01:31:19.500 --> 01:31:20.750
Don't make me laugh.

01:31:20.958 --> 01:31:26.292
You and S.H.E.L.L. should set off on
a journey to the world of destruction

01:31:26.500 --> 01:31:28.292
being opened by this mass of hatred!

01:31:30.167 --> 01:31:34.125
The way humans should be has evolved...

01:31:34.333 --> 01:31:36.125
...right now.

01:31:40.458 --> 01:31:44.250
Now that it has come to this, Masao Horiki,

01:31:44.458 --> 01:31:47.750
your scheme will not work.

01:31:48.667 --> 01:31:51.458
The Third Applicant

01:31:51.667 --> 01:31:54.333
will bury you!

01:32:04.000 --> 01:32:07.458
He will protect us.

01:32:08.792 --> 01:32:13.833
He will protect the Second Applicant
living inside us

01:32:14.042 --> 01:32:17.958
and the future of restoration she believed in.

01:32:26.542 --> 01:32:28.125
Why...?

01:32:31.625 --> 01:32:34.625
The two of them are calling to each other.

01:32:34.833 --> 01:32:38.167
It looks like the world that
Yoshiko Hiiragi dreamed of...

01:32:38.375 --> 01:32:41.208
...does not include you all.

01:32:41.417 --> 01:32:44.292
It is all for the sake of the citizens...

01:32:44.500 --> 01:32:50.125
We came to preserve this society...

01:32:53.292 --> 01:32:56.208
| won't let you deny that...!

01:33:19.708 --> 01:33:22.667
Is this the fruit of her faith?

01:33:22.875 --> 01:33:25.250
You sinful woman.

01:33:26.000 --> 01:33:27.250
Yoshiko,

01:33:27.458 --> 01:33:29.375
kill Yozo.

01:33:37.250 --> 01:33:41.667
The health standard is in a shambles...

01:33:41.875 --> 01:33:44.292
It's the end of the world as we know it...

01:33:53.833 --> 01:33:55.292
We can't wait any longer!

01:33:55.500 --> 01:33:57.167
We'll be in danger if we don't evacuate!

01:33:57.375 --> 01:33:59.500
Wait until we get everyone on!

01:34:04.167 --> 01:34:08.417
Are you trying to drag S.H.E.L.L.
into the Lost phenomenon...?

01:34:12.667 --> 01:34:14.208
Look, Yozo!

01:34:14.417 --> 01:34:16.833
A lump of meat that has lost
its reason and its heart,

01:34:17.042 --> 01:34:20.583
just shivering in fear
from a vague uneasiness...

01:34:20.792 --> 01:34:25.208
This is the shadow of the illusion
that Yoshiko believed in!

01:34:52.000 --> 01:34:53.792
This is the end, Yozo!

01:34:54.000 --> 01:34:55.042
Come with me!

01:34:55.250 --> 01:34:57.625
Become my Orpheus!

01:34:57.833 --> 01:35:01.792
I will kill you.

01:35:58.667 --> 01:36:01.500
Yoshiko is now doing my will.

01:36:05.292 --> 01:36:08.583
This is not Yoshiko...!

01:36:08.792 --> 01:36:11.792
The fate of this woman is to be used.

01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:13.875
If you pity her,

01:36:14.083 --> 01:36:16.875
then you release her from this fate!

01:36:37.625 --> 01:36:41.708
In order to protect Yoshiko from
the illusion that trapped her,

01:36:41.917 --> 01:36:43.958
you and that same Yoshiko
are killing each other!

01:36:44.167 --> 01:36:46.500
How absurd!

01:36:46.708 --> 01:36:49.417
Yoshiko... stop...

01:36:49.625 --> 01:36:50.792
Don't come...!

01:36:51.000 --> 01:36:53.000
You really are a fool!

01:37:14.875 --> 01:37:19.083
You bury the one you love
and can't even release her.

01:37:19.292 --> 01:37:22.458
That's the difference between you and me.

01:37:40.792 --> 01:37:42.917
| win...

01:38:03.958 --> 01:38:06.167
Raise the output to max!

01:38:10.250 --> 01:38:13.792
With this, it can end...

01:38:30.250 --> 01:38:31.750
Yoshiko...

01:38:33.750 --> 01:38:37.792
Yoshiko...!

01:38:38.000 --> 01:38:42.458
Yozo...!

01:39:08.458 --> 01:39:10.042
Yoshiko...

01:39:12.167 --> 01:39:14.000
Yozo...

01:39:16.458 --> 01:39:19.125
Let us die together.

01:39:19.333 --> 01:39:21.792
We were wrong...

01:39:22.000 --> 01:39:23.958
...about everything...

01:40:14.708 --> 01:40:20.083
The sky... is blue...

01:40:20.292 --> 01:40:24.167
The expression on your face says you
messed up your forced double suicide.

01:40:24.375 --> 01:40:26.500
This isn't the end yet.

01:40:29.417 --> 01:40:34.208
| will destroy S.H.E.L.L.'s
main body that is under this.

01:40:34.417 --> 01:40:35.792
Help me.

01:40:40.875 --> 01:40:45.250
| had a patient with an incurable disease...

01:40:45.458 --> 01:40:50.708
| thought that if S.H.E.L.L. was completed,
then she could be saved.

01:40:52.375 --> 01:40:56.750
In the middle of the experiment,
when she became Lost,

01:40:56.958 --> 01:40:59.292
| knew for sure...

01:40:59.500 --> 01:41:03.083
...that S.H.E.L.L. was wrong.

01:41:04.792 --> 01:41:09.583
You loved her.

01:41:09.792 --> 01:41:14.292
You just can't forgive yourself
for not being able to save her.

01:41:14.500 --> 01:41:19.833
| have the future that Yoshiko showed me.

01:41:20.833 --> 01:41:23.667
You will just lose sight of yourself...

01:41:23.875 --> 01:41:26.292
Like in that self-portrait.

01:41:27.833 --> 01:41:31.333
| won't lose sight of myself anymore.

01:41:33.708 --> 01:41:35.417
Just do it.

01:41:51.167 --> 01:41:53.208
Shizuko...

01:42:05.750 --> 01:42:09.500
"Six Months Later"

01:42:10.833 --> 01:42:13.792
After the operation ends,
we'll meet up at the collection point.

01:42:14.000 --> 01:42:20.500
This is Shibuta. We have 283
confirmed Lost around the tower.

01:42:20.708 --> 01:42:27.792
By S.H.E.L.L.'s estimates, about 10% of those
contain factors of the Second Applicant.

01:42:28.000 --> 01:42:32.083
We have linked to your vision
and are monitoring the Lost.

01:42:32.292 --> 01:42:35.583
This is going to be a long night, Yozo.

01:42:37.917 --> 01:42:42.375
Humans are neither Qualified nor Disqualified,

01:42:42.583 --> 01:42:47.625
and we don't know when the chaos
of the health standard will return to normal.

01:42:47.833 --> 01:42:52.167
Those of us who survived
must stall for time...

01:42:57.625 --> 01:43:06.500
The futures that Masao, Yoshiko,
and I saw are vying for this world.

01:43:16.958 --> 01:43:22.500
Mine has been a life of much shame.

01:43:48.917 --> 01:43:52.792
Yozo... Yozo... Yozo...

01:43:53.000 --> 01:43:56.917
Until the future Yoshiko believed in arrives,

01:43:57.125 --> 01:43:59.750
| will die over and over,

01:43:59.958 --> 01:44:02.375
and be resurrected as many times as it takes.

01:44:40.750 --> 01:44:45.292
I look into your eyes
but I don't see you no more

01:44:47.042 --> 01:44:51.583
Just a replica of what used to be you before

01:44:52.917 --> 01:44:56.542
You say all the right things,
do all the right things

01:44:56.750 --> 01:44:59.750
But your heart's not in it

01:44:59.958 --> 01:45:05.083
I look into your eyes
but I just don't feel you no more

01:45:05.292 --> 01:45:08.333
it's all about the way that you move

01:45:08.542 --> 01:45:11.583
Something's different from usual

01:45:11.792 --> 01:45:14.792
you're fadin' out, even your heart

01:45:15.000 --> 01:45:18.125
Even though I looked,
I can't find the true you

01:45:18.333 --> 01:45:21.333
Even if I yell, my voice won't reach

01:45:21.542 --> 01:45:24.625
The you I loved isn't here anymore

01:45:24.833 --> 01:45:26.250
I'm missing you so bad

01:45:26.458 --> 01:45:27.875
Come back

01:45:28.083 --> 01:45:29.625
baby bring your heart back

01:45:32.000 --> 01:45:32.583
Hold up

01:45:32.792 --> 01:45:33.417
Stand up

01:45:33.625 --> 01:45:34.125
Hold up

01:45:34.333 --> 01:45:35.500
Stand up

01:45:35.708 --> 01:45:36.292
Got nobody

01:45:36.500 --> 01:45:38.000
Until your light's brought back

01:45:38.208 --> 01:45:41.292
Where did you go

01:45:41.500 --> 01:45:42.750
No reconoces mas

01:45:42.958 --> 01:45:44.458
No sabes ya ni quien soy

01:45:44.667 --> 01:45:47.792
Where did you go

01:45:48.000 --> 01:45:51.958
No se si fue mentira o una
falsa realidad

01:45:52.167 --> 01:45:55.208
Ya no pareces humana no tienes un corazon

01:45:55.417 --> 01:45:57.542
y solo dices cosas por decir y no las sientes

01:45:57.750 --> 01:46:00.750
Where did you go

01:46:00.958 --> 01:46:01.958
Where did you

01:46:02.167 --> 01:46:02.792
Where did you

01:46:03.000 --> 01:46:05.375
Where did you go

01:46:07.042 --> 01:46:10.042
I was born a cynic, became a critic,
rather be a villain

01:46:10.250 --> 01:46:10.958
than be half committed,

01:46:11.167 --> 01:46:12.625
half-ass hero, don't wanna hear it

01:46:12.833 --> 01:46:14.167
Don't wanna take a stab, if I can't kill it

01:46:14.375 --> 01:46:15.833
Yeah I get it... Yeah I get it

01:46:16.042 --> 01:46:17.417
Trying to help out and make me fit in

01:46:17.625 --> 01:46:19.417
Telling me we are the same, but you don't know

01:46:19.625 --> 01:46:21.208
that you're in the game I invented

01:46:21.417 --> 01:46:24.417
Woke up this morning put my dreams on hold

01:46:24.625 --> 01:46:28.917
Auto-pilot conscience emotionally sleep mode

01:46:29.125 --> 01:46:30.583
But I'm just

01:46:30.792 --> 01:46:32.208
excited, and before I know it

01:46:32.417 --> 01:46:34.875
There's the Lost phenomenon

01:46:35.083 --> 01:46:39.500
I look into your eyes
but I don't see you no more

01:46:41.250 --> 01:46:46.083
Just a replica of what used to be you before

01:46:47.167 --> 01:46:50.792
You say all the right things,
do all the right things

01:46:51.000 --> 01:46:54.000
But your heart's not in it

01:46:54.208 --> 01:46:59.292
I look into your eyes
but I just don't feel you no more

01:46:59.500 --> 01:47:02.583
it hurts because I used to know you

01:47:02.792 --> 01:47:05.833
The light in the depths of your eyes

01:47:06.042 --> 01:47:09.083
Disappeared, covered by darkness

01:47:09.292 --> 01:47:12.417
Hey, where are you? I'm losing you

01:47:12.625 --> 01:47:15.667
The sights we saw
when we were holding hands

01:47:15.875 --> 01:47:18.875
I don't even have memories of them anymore

01:47:19.083 --> 01:47:20.542
tell me can we rewind

01:47:20.750 --> 01:47:22.208
to those days you were mine

01:47:22.417 --> 01:47:23.875
I want to see you again...

01:47:26.333 --> 01:47:26.833
Hold up

01:47:27.042 --> 01:47:27.708
Stand up

01:47:27.917 --> 01:47:28.458
Hold up

01:47:28.667 --> 01:47:29.708
Stand up

01:47:29.917 --> 01:47:31.000
I don't got nobody

01:47:31.208 --> 01:47:33.875
Until you come back

01:48:12.500 --> 01:48:18.792
No eres humana, no eres humana,
no eres, no eres, no eres humana

01:48:19.000 --> 01:48:24.292
I want to breathe life into you

01:48:24.500 --> 01:48:27.875
Where did you go

